            "review_title": "Review at Ryu Gyong",
            "review_text": "lgreger\nGothenburg, Sweden210 contributions\n0\nExcellent Korean food in HCMC\nNov 2016 • Couples\nThis is one of the best North Korean restaurants I have visited (and I have been to most of them).\nVery tasty fish soup, kimchi and a lot of small complimentary dishes to reasonable prices.\nThe serviceminded ladies from Pyongyang gives the traditional DPRK song and dance show during the meal.\nThe only issue was lack of Teadong Beer (could this be organized afor our next visit?).\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 15, 2017",
