            "review_title": "Review at Ryu Gyong",
            "review_text": "Timothy D\nNorth Vancouver, Canada8 contributions\n0\nIf you want to try something different\nSep 2016 • Couples\nI told my gf I wanted to goto a restaurant owned by Pyong Yang, NKK. She thought I was nuts and didn't even knew it existed. But she found it, and not only did I enjoy wonderful authentic (I assume) food, they sang Happy Birthday in NK/VN/English. Wasn't easy to find, but worth checking out if your up for something out of the ordinary.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 1, 2016",
